 "remarks": "Spacious 3 bedroom, 3.5 bath townhome built in 2020 and impeccably maintained, one of three side by side homes in the desirable Springdale neighborhood of Stamford. The main level is anchored by a large living room with fireplace and an open kitchen and dining area with direct access to a private patio, plus a balcony and a convenient powder room. The bedroom level features a primary suite with two walk in closets and a spa inspired bath with double vanity, along with two additional bedrooms and a full hall bath. The lower level offers a family room with a full bath, ideal as a playroom, home office, or guest bedroom. Hardwood floors, a 2 car garage, and central air complete the home. Commuters will love being 5 minutes from the Springdale train station, about 60 minutes to Grand Central, with easy access to both the Merritt Parkway and Interstate 95 and supermarkets close by. Move right in.",
